                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15157949" author="agoncharuk" created="Mon, 22 Feb 2016 23:36:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Attached a patch that adds a test reproducing the issue and a suggested fix. Need to verify TC.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15159975" author="agoncharuk" created="Wed, 24 Feb 2016 00:45:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;After additional debugging it turned out that &lt;tt&gt;get()&lt;/tt&gt; inside a pessimistic transaction and OFFHEAP_TIERED memory mode will always trigger a cache store load. Added corresponding test and fixed in the same PR.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15160253" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 24 Feb 2016 06:29:21 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reviewed, looks good, but I think it makes sense to add similar test for &apos;keepBinary&apos; flag.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15166619" author="agoncharuk" created="Thu, 25 Feb 2016 02:46:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Added the test. Merged to master (commit 711fe3783cb622ae134df899397505d2813d50ac)&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
